# animations.rec: the Better Combat attack animations (assets/bettercombat) weapons.rec's attack_1..3 lines
# name (rogue/kinds.go reads it); not a tile mapping, the remapper never opens it.
#
#   upswing   the fraction of the animation where the blow lands

%rec: animation
%doc: Attack animations (assets/bettercombat): upswing is the fraction of the animation where the blow lands

id: one_handed_slam
